    "seg_start": 55.28,
    "audio_end_s": 57.28,
    "accum_s": 2.0,
    "lat_s": 0.14009308815002441,
    "text": "정확히는 내부 결제 전이라 확정."
   },
   {
    "seg_start": 55.28,
    "audio_end_s": 58.0,
    "accum_s": 2.72,
    "lat_s": 0.16814112663269043,
